pts/purchase\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>A&nbsp;game looking to combine the micro-management of colony simulation games&nbsp;and the macro-management of turn-based, civilization strategy games, with flavors of&nbsp;primitive society simulation and fantasy themes.</p>\r\n<p>This game is a tall order, so we ask for your support. Something as simple as words of encouragement is appreciated! The game is currently in development (&quot;indev&quot;), which comes before pre-alpha. As such, expect a serious lack of both content and features. So why download the game? Revolutions, Wizardry, and Crypts*&nbsp;has an internal engine built from the ground-up using libraries like SDL, Direct3D 11, and Direct2D, among others. So, testing the games on different hardware and architectures is out of reach for us, but this is where you can help! Simply play the game and report any bugs, or simply send in the debug log. And even if no bugs form, send in reports anyways. Knowing that a certain version of the game works well on different platforms is beneficial as well!</p>\r\n<p>*Game name is not finalized.</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_6899682\" class=\"game_info_panel_widge